<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div n="2" type="jAn"><p>Schöne schwarze <hi rendition="#g">Dinte</hi> empfiehlt zur geneigten Abnahme</p><lb/>
<p> <space dim="horizontal"/>  C. Hundt in Hattingen.</p></div><lb/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div n="2" type="jAn"><head>Bettfedern &amp; Daunen,</head><lb/>
